## Integration

Use the CPU module to spawn and simulate chunk-local plants, upload `BuildGpuInstances()` to a structured buffer each frame, and render species meshes with hardware instancing. For best visual range, combine these runtime systems with branch-module or L-system plant generation for close assets and lower-detail impostors or simplified instances farther away, since procedural plant pipelines commonly pair structural generation with instancing and LOD.[5][6][4][2]

